  - table: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5be61a8f2561b1b459eeba0252755c94, type: 2}
    tableContent:
    - key: TicTacToeDescription
      value: "\u0130ki oyuncu s\u0131rayla \xFC\xE7 \xE7arp\u0131 \xFC\xE7l\xFCk bir \u0131zgaraya X ve O koyar. Kendi i\u015Faretinden \xFC\xE7\xFCn\xFC ilk hizalayan kazan\u0131r."
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: 3DTestDescription
      value: "Oyun penceresinde canl\u0131 3D kamera g\xF6r\xFCnt\xFCs\xFCn\xFC g\xF6steren k\xFC\xE7\xFCk bir demo."
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: EmptyGameDescription
      value: "Bir oyun penceresinin nas\u0131l g\xF6r\xFCnd\xFC\u011F\xFCn\xFC g\xF6steren bo\u015F bir \xF6rnek oyun."
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
  - table: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f6e6b4aaa6f2f004e915a560d310d6a5, type: 2}
    tableContent:
    - key: SampleMail1Subject
      value: "Gelen kutundan merhaba"
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: SampleMail1Content
      value: "Bu, bir e-posta \xF6\u011Fesinden olu\u015Fturulmu\u015F \xF6rnek bir iletidir. E-posta \xF6\u011Feleri ek dosyalar ve istedi\u011Fin metni ta\u015F\u0131yabilir.\n\n\u0130letilerin nas\u0131l g\xF6r\xFCnd\xFC\u011F\xFCn\xFC g\xF6rmek i\xE7in kullanabilirsin."
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: SampleMail2Subject
      value: "Toplant\u0131 notlar\u0131"
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: SampleMail2Content
      value: "Gelen kutusu listesinde g\xF6r\xFCnen ba\u015Fka bir \xF6rnek ileti."
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: SampleMail3Subject
      value: "G\xF6nderilmi\u015F e-posta \xF6rne\u011Fi"
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: SampleMail3Content
      value: "'G\xF6nderilenler' klas\xF6r\xFCnde duran bir \xF6rnek ileti."
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: SampleMail4Subject
      value: "Gereksiz e-posta \xF6rne\u011Fi"
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: SampleMail4Content
      value: "'Gereksiz' klas\xF6r\xFCnde duran bir \xF6rnek ileti."
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
  - table: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c426ec06101062a4dbc9ef60778cd378, type: 2}
    tableContent:
    - key: ExampleChat_1
      value: "Selam, orada m\u0131s\u0131n?"
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: ExampleChat_2
      value: "Buraday\u0131m, sende ne var ne yok?"
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: ExampleChat_3
      value: "Pek bir \u015Fey yok. B\xF6l\xFCm tasar\u0131mlar\u0131n\u0131 bitirdin mi?"
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: ExampleChat_4
      value: "Neredeyse. Teslim tarihi \xE7ok s\u0131k\u0131\u015F\u0131k, o y\xFCzden birka\xE7 fikri k\u0131rpmam gerekti."
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: ExampleChat_5
      value: "Hatalar\u0131 hi\xE7 anlatmayay\u0131m..."
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: ExampleChat_6
      value: "Yo\u011Fun mesai haftalar\u0131 beni bitiriyor. Umar\u0131m bu yak\u0131nda biter."
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: ExampleChat_7
      value: "Bende de \xF6yle."
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: ExampleChat_8
      value: "\xC7\u0131k\u0131\u015F tarihinin ertelendi\u011Fini duydun mu?"
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: ExampleChat_9
      value: "Hay\u0131r, ben de \u015Fimdi internette g\xF6rd\xFCm."
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: ExampleChat_10
      value: "\u015Eu y\xFCze bak!"
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: ExampleChat_11
      value: "Ahh, ne kadar tatl\u0131 bir \xE7ocuk!"
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: ExampleChat2_1
      value: "Erin!!! \xC7ok uzun zaman oldu, nas\u0131ls\u0131n?"
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: ExampleChat2_2
      value: "Hep ayn\u0131, \xE7ok \xE7al\u0131\u015F\u0131yorum. Son zamanlarda epey stresliyim. Sen?"
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: ExampleChat2_3
      value: "Asl\u0131nda i\u015Fimden ayr\u0131ld\u0131m. D\xFCr\xFCst olmak gerekirse \xE7ok daha iyi hissediyorum."
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: ExampleChat2_4
      value: "Mutluysan sorun yok, \xF6nemli olan bu!"
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: ExampleChat2_5
      value: "Bu arada numaran\u0131 kaybettim ve uzun s\xFCre sana ula\u015Famad\u0131m... kusura bakma!"
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: ExampleChat2_6
      value: "Art\u0131k elinde ;)"
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: ExampleChat2_7
      value: "Peki... bir ara kahve i\xE7meye ne dersin?"
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: ExampleChat2_8
      value: "Doyas\u0131ya sohbet etmek g\xFCzel olurdu ;)"
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: ExampleChat2_9
      value: "Olur, neden olmas\u0131n."
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: ExampleChat2_10
      value: "Harika! O zaman yar\u0131n ak\u015Fam be\u015F gibi?"
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: ExampleChat2_11
      value: "M\xFCkemmel, g\xF6r\xFC\u015F\xFCr\xFCz!"
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: ExampleChat2_12
      value: "\u0130dare eder, sen nas\u0131ls\u0131n?"
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: ExampleChat3_1
      value: "Tebrikler! 1.000.000 $ de\u011Ferinde bir \xF6d\xFCl i\xE7in se\xE7ildin. \xD6d\xFCl\xFCn\xFC almak i\xE7in bu iletiye cevap ver. Tamamen ger\xE7ek ve kesinlikle bir doland\u0131r\u0131c\u0131l\u0131k de\u011Fil."
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: ExampleDynamicMessage_1
      value: "Cevap almak i\xE7in \"What's up?\" yazabilirsin."
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: ExampleDynamicMessage_2
      value: "Burada her \u015Fey yolunda, umar\u0131m sen de iyisindir!"
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: ExampleDynamicMessage_3
      value: "Ne oldu?"
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: ExampleStoryTeller_1
      value: "\xD6nceden kurgulanm\u0131\u015F bir konu\u015Fma i\xE7in <b>StoryTeller</b> \xF6zelli\u011Fini a\xE7."
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: ExampleStoryTeller_2
      value: "StoryTeller \xF6\u011Feleri, oyuncunun se\xE7ti\u011Fi cevaba g\xF6re konu\u015Fmay\u0131 farkl\u0131 y\xF6nlere ay\u0131rabilir."
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: ExampleStoryTeller_3
      value: "Ba\u015Fka bir \xF6\u011Feyi kimli\u011Fiyle zincirlemek i\xE7in <b>'Call After'</b> kullan."
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: ExampleStoryTeller_4
      value: "Kendi kodundan bir \xF6\u011Feyi <b>MessagingManager.CreateStoryTeller(\"Chat ID\", \"StoryTeller ID\");</b> ile ba\u015Flatabilirsin."
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: ExampleStoryTeller_5
      value: "\xC7al\u0131\u015F\u0131rken g\xF6rmek ister misin? <b>SEQ_0</b> yaz. 'Debug StoryTeller' a\xE7\u0131kken bir \xF6\u011Fenin kimli\u011Fini yazmak onu oynat\u0131r."
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: SEQ0_1
      value: "Selam, nas\u0131l gidiyor?"
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: SEQ0_R1B
      value: "Pek iyi de\u011Fil"
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: SEQ0_R1C
      value: "A\xE7\u0131k\xE7as\u0131 son zamanlarda kendimi \xE7ok k\xF6t\xFC hissediyorum..."
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: SEQ0_R1F
      value: "Eyvah, ne oldu?"
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: SEQ0_R2B
      value: "\u0130dare eder"
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: SEQ0_R2C
      value: "Fena de\u011Fil, sen nas\u0131ls\u0131n?"
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: SEQ0_R2F
      value: "Bende de \xF6yle."
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: SEQ0_R3B
      value: "Harika"
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: SEQ0_R3C
      value: "\xC7ok iyi, ya sen?"
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: SEQ0_R3F
      value: "O zaman ikimiz de iyiyiz!"
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: SEQ1_1
      value: "Sadece..."
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: SEQ1_R1B
      value: "Yorgunum"
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: SEQ1_R1C
      value: "Bilmiyorum, sadece bitkinim"
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: SEQ1_R1F
      value: "Ne zamand\u0131r?"
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: SEQ1_R2B
      value: "Karn\u0131m a\u011Fr\u0131yor"
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: SEQ1_R2C
      value: "Karn\u0131m ger\xE7ekten \xE7ok a\u011Fr\u0131yor"
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: SEQ1_R2F
      value: "Yak\u0131nda bir doktora g\xF6r\xFCnmelisin."
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: SEQ1_R3B
      value: "Uyuyam\u0131yorum"
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: SEQ1_R3C
      value: "Bu aralar uyuyam\u0131yorum, nedenini bilmiyorum"
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: SEQ1_R3F
      value: "Umar\u0131m ciddi bir \u015Fey de\u011Fildir!"
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: SEQ2_1
      value: "Bir ara bulu\u015Fmal\u0131y\u0131z"
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: SEQ2_R1B
      value: "Olur"
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: SEQ2_R1C
      value: "Olur, g\xFCzel olur :)"
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: SEQ2_R1F
      value: "S\xFCper! Ne zaman m\xFCsait oldu\u011Funu s\xF6yle :)"
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: SEQ2_R2B
      value: "Me\u015Fgul\xFCm"
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: SEQ2_R2C
      value: "San\u0131r\u0131m olmaz, bu aralar \xE7ok yo\u011Funum :/"
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: SEQ2_R2F
      value: "Neyse. Belki ba\u015Fka zaman."
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: SEQ2_R3B
      value: "Hay\u0131r, sa\u011F ol"
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: SEQ2_R3C
      value: "Hay\u0131r, sa\u011F ol, ben kat\u0131lmayay\u0131m."
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: SEQ2_R3F
      value: "Of :'/"
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: SEQ3_1
      value: "Hadi, bir sohbet edelim mi?"
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: SEQ3_R1B
      value: "Olur"
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: SEQ3_R1C
      value: "Olur, neden olmas\u0131n :)"
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: SEQ3_R1F
      value: "Harika! Vaktin olunca haber ver :)"
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: SEQ3_R2B
      value: "Me\u015Fgul\xFCm"
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: SEQ3_R2C
      value: "Sanm\u0131yorum, \u015Fu an i\u015Flerim \xE7ok yo\u011Fun :/"
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: SEQ3_R2F
      value: "Yaz\u0131k. Sonra yine deneriz."
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: SEQ3_R3B
      value: "Hay\u0131r, sa\u011F ol"
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: SEQ3_R3C
      value: "Hay\u0131r, sa\u011F ol, istemem."
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: SEQ3_R3F
      value: "Bu can\u0131m\u0131 yakt\u0131 :'/"
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: SEQ1-1_1
      value: "Kendine iyi bak, biraz su i\xE7."
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: SEQ1-1_R1B
      value: "Tamam"
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: SEQ1-1_R1C
      value: "Evet, i\xE7erim"
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: SEQ1-1_R2B
      value: "Hay\u0131r"
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: SEQ1-1_R2C
      value: "Hay\u0131r, suyu pek sevmem"
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: SEQ1-1_R2F
      value: "Neden? Su sa\u011Fl\u0131\u011F\u0131n i\xE7in \xE7ok \xF6nemli."
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: BeginningIndicator
      value: "Konu\u015Fman\u0131z burada ba\u015Fl\u0131yor"
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: TypeIndicator
      value: "Bir mesaj yaz..."
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
  - table: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 77e4b89821ef6914c86f04674a1d6b5b, type: 2}
    tableContent:
    - key: SampleNote1Title
      value: "\u0130lk not"
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: SampleNote1Content
      value: "Bu not, not defteri y\xF6neticisi taraf\u0131ndan olu\u015Fturuldu. Y\xF6netici haz\u0131r notlar da ekleyebilir.\n\nBu metni ve ba\u015Fl\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 da de\u011Fi\u015Ftirebilirsin. \u0130kisinden birine t\u0131klay\u0131p yazmaya ba\u015Fla."
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: SampleNote2Title
      value: "Biliyor muydun?"
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: SampleNote2Content
      value: "Pasifik Okyanusu D\xFCnya y\xFCzeyinin yakla\u015F\u0131k \xFC\xE7te birini kaplar ve t\xFCm k\u0131talar\u0131n toplam\u0131ndan daha geni\u015Ftir. Denizin bilinen en derin noktas\u0131 olan Mariana \xC7ukuru da burada, y\xFCzeyin yakla\u015F\u0131k on bir kilometre alt\u0131ndad\u0131r."
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
  - table: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 931c4ecb0810e844098897ad26a2de6c, type: 2}
    tableContent:
    - key: HomePageTitle
      value: "Ba\u015Flang\u0131\xE7 Sayfas\u0131"
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: NoConnectionTitle
      value: "\xC7evrimd\u0131\u015F\u0131"
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: NotFoundTitle
      value: "Sayfa Bulunamad\u0131"
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: NoConnectionErrorTitle
      value: "Eyvah!"
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: NoConnectionErrorDesc
      value: "\u0130nternet ba\u011Flant\u0131s\u0131 bulunamad\u0131.\nA\u011F\u0131n\u0131 kontrol edip yeniden dene."
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: NoutFoundErrorTitle
      value: "Hmm..."
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
    - key: NoutFoundErrorDesc
      value: "Bu sayfaya ula\u015F\u0131lam\u0131yor.\nBiraz sonra yeniden dene."
      audioValue: {fileID: 0}
      spriteValue: {fileID: 0}
  - table: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f0c6e838ab9555c409da2eb645d16de2, type: 2}
    tableContent:
